  "content": "<p>這個模組新增了可以讓你穿越維度的糕點。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如果你以前玩過空島生存整合包，你可能用過類似的維度傳送方式。</p><p>這個模組目前增加了蛋糕，可以讓你傳送到主世界、終界和地獄。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個模組也支援暮光森林、失落城市和狩獵維度。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz 合作夥伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼「mrbysco」即可享有首月八折優惠</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如有問題，歡迎加入我的 Discord。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord 連結\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我們嗎？</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
